Bubble Zoom NPU models
======================

Bundled in every build type except FOSS. They are alternative forms of the models described in
models/NOTICE, for Qualcomm NPUs (Hexagon HTP), and are redistributed under the same licence as their
source (Apache License 2.0, see models/LICENSE).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Ahead-of-time compiled models, per SoC (models/npu/<soc>/)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  sm8850/panel_detector_v2.tflite
      models/panel_detector_v2.tflite (models/NOTICE, section 3), compiled for the Snapdragon 8 Elite Gen 5
      (SM8850) NPU with LiteRT 2.3.0's Qualcomm compiler plugin (QAIRT 2.50), fp16.

  sm8850/bubble_detector_v4s_head.tflite
      Backbone and hybrid encoder of detector-v4-s (models/NOTICE, section 1), up to the flattened
      encoder memory [1,8400,256]: models/bubble_detector_v4s_head.tflite compiled for SM8850 like
      the above, fp16.

  sm8850/sam_encoder_edgesam_v2.tflite
      EdgeSAM image encoder (models/NOTICE, section 2): models/sam_encoder_edgesam_v2.tflite compiled for
      SM8850 like the above, fp16.

On other Snapdragon SoCs with a Hexagon NPU the plain models are compiled on the device the first
time (cached afterwards in the app's cache directory).

No trained weights were changed beyond format conversion / precision for on-device inference.

The Qualcomm runtime and on-device compiler that run the models on the NPU (libQnn*.so, from Maven Central
com.qualcomm.qti:qnn-runtime) is proprietary Qualcomm software under the Qualcomm AI Stack licence,
distributed in object code as part of this application only.
